/* Clean (lead, 18 Nov; owner, 21 Nov): it stays bare, the line it is in a chat. The animated mark has no tile, fill or padding
   behind it ("I don't think we need bg padding behind the animated dots"): it sits in a 20px box on the line's centre line,
   with the words 10px after it. The mark is the accent, which is white in Clean's dark mode, the one
   thing that moves; the seconds count in even figures */
:root[data-style="clean"] .v2 .ths-mk{width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:0;background:none;box-shadow:none}
:root[data-style="clean"] .v2 .ths-t{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
