/* the clock follows the title while it works, as in "Checking the pricing page 7s", and goes once the header says what the
   work came to (a finished state has no elapsed clock); the chevron keeps the right edge, where the steps' times end too */
:root[data-style="clean"] .v2 .tk-title{flex:0 1 auto;font-weight:500}
