.v2 .rc-rows .num{color:var(--fg)}
.v2 .rc-f{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;margin-top:var(--s-3);padding-top:var(--s-3);border-top:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--line) 50%,transparent)}
.v2 .rc-cap-t{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-size:13px;color:var(--fg2);cursor:pointer}
.v2 .rc-go{overflow:hidden;justify-content:flex-start}
/* Clean (owner, 17 and 18 Nov): a round card with its hairline, its content 16px in from every edge; the status chip in its
   status colours; a 6px grey rail with the accent fill (the warning mark at the cap) and an ink budget line. The rows are
   plain text (nothing to press, so no hover fill). The foot strip holds the controls 8px from the card's edges: the cap's
   switch is a quiet control whose switch sits on the content's 16px edge, its hover round it, and the button a 28px pill,
   concentric with the card's corner */
