   foot strip, whose top edge takes the hairline's place and whose own 12px padding is that room (owner, 21 Nov: "due today +
   cta should be a container with grey bg"); the line items stay in the body, 16px above it */
.v2 .pyx-ft{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--s-3)}
.v2 .pyx-t{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding-top:var(--s-3);border-top:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--line) 50%,transparent);color:var(--fg);font-size:13.5px;line-height:20px}
:root[data-style="clean"] .v2 .pyx-ft{margin:var(--s-1) calc(-1 * var(--s-4)) calc(-1 * var(--s-4));padding:var(--s-3) var(--s-4);background:var(--strip);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0 0 var(--r-card) var(--r-card)}
